  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Society Action to Prevent and Mitigate COVID-19 (CiSAC-19)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OO1. To contribute to the enhancement of Lao Civil Society Organisations (CSOs) participation and capacity in the prevention and risk-mitigation of the COVID-19 pandemic in Lao PDR; SO1. Central and local authorities of Lao PDR are supported by Lao CSOs in the response and mitigation of present and future health, social and economic impacts of the COVID-19 pandemic and through civil society led interventions resilience of vulnerable groups is built on local community level</narrative>
  </description>
